WEBVTT

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:34.080
Last one!{AMS: added "one" for english equivalent}

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.040
<i>Just this causes me to breathe so hard?</i>

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:01.730
<i>I guess it just means that I'm out of shape.</i>

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.390
Damn! This is completely different from the deal.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:08.750
Why do we have to do this kind of practice?

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.930
Huh? Did you say something?

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.190
N-No...

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.700
Sorry, guys...

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.800
Hold out a bit longer...

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:20.040
At least until they accept this club as an actual team... just a little longer.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:44.550
So, you're all practicing.

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:45.650
I'm glad, I'm glad.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.530
Then... can you take a break and gather around please?

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:58.410
Since this splendid field is done, starting today,

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.750
you're going to start practicing baseball.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:07.460
I'm an amateur, so I'm not confident enough to coach baseball.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:11.080
So, until you guys become a real team,

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:16.180
I've asked for some people who specialize in that area to become your short-term coaches.

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:18.010
Please, come in.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:23.690
Hey.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.190
D-Dad!?

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:29.150
D-Dad!?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.080
What?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.970
B-By "Dad" you mean-

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:40.410
Hey! I've seen this guy on television before!

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.660
Hey, you, by Shigeno...

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.660
You're the son of the Ocean's Shigeno?

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.860
Well, I guess you could say that.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:52.800
Who's this? I've never seen this guy before.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.550
He's someone Shigeno-san knows.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:04:00.070
A coach for the Yokohama Little League team, Hashimoto-san.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.520
Nice to meet you.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.990
Huh? The old man with the sunglasses!?

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:07.100
It's been a while, Honda.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:10.680
Wait, but why are you here?

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.800
So, anyway, starting today,

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.200
we're going to beat the basics of baseball into you.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:19.970
Our catchphrase will be: "Beat Kaido. Aim for Koshien."

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:23.070
Our catchphrase will be: "Beat Kaido. Aim for Koshien."

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.300
Of course it's going to be tough, so you'd better be prepared!

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.390
What?

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:30.860
But we don't have to practice, right?

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.010
That's right...

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:34.270
We're going to start with hard liners first.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:35.790
Everyone get back!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:43.480
H-Hey, wait a minute, Dad!

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.780
I didn't hear anything about this!

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:50.270
Shouldn't you at least talk this over with me beforehand?

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.890
What are you doing?

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.280
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.700
Stay back!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.290
We'll start with you wearing the glasses!

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.290
Here I go! I won't hold back!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:10.170
Quit dodging it! Watch the ball carefully and catch it!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:19.420
Hey, hey, this is too much all of a sudden...

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.220
What's up with those coaches?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.480
A-Are you all right, Miyazaki?

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:31.480
Get up! Don't be such a baby just because of that!

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.240
Quit it! What the hell do you think you're doing?

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:36.960
I worked so hard to gather all these members...

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.450
If you keep doing this, everyone'll quit!

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.650
Be quiet.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.870
People who want to quit should just quit.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.000
A baseball team that's just numbers... I'll crush it.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.010
A baseball team that's just numbers... I'll crush it.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.670
W-What?

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.870
Next! You there!

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.840
Y-You've got to be kidding me!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.520
Why do we have to catch those hard liners?

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:17.280
Shigeno-san!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.240
I admired you as a baseball player, but...

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.200
I cannot be satisfied with this sudden practice!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.310
Most of those guys are amateurs.

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.920
There's no way they can get those hard liners.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.770
Isn't that a bit dangerous!?

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:36.430
That's right, Dad!

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.380
Dangerous?

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.070
Of course it is!

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.220
Baseball is dangerous if you're playing all willy-nilly!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:49.640
Don't tell me you guys are wearing that uniform with half-hearted feelings.

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:52.510
It doesn't matter if you're an amateur or not.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:56.110
I want to see if you have the will to do this or not!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.070
"The will to do this"?

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:04.550
If there is anyone here that isn't going to play baseball seriously, leave right now.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:08.410
We're not nice enough to be dealing with the likes of you!

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:10.860
W-What the hell are you saying, Dad?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.500
The fact that there aren't a whole lot of members, and the fact that other than these guys,

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.820
Seishuu has no other guys... You know that!

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.640
If these guys quit, I'll not only be unable to beat Kaido,

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.260
but I won't even be able to participate in games!

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:25.480
What sort of parent crushes their own kid's dream!?{AMS: og tl : Where in this world is there a parent who crushes their own kid's dreams?}

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.100
"Dream," you say?

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:36.050
The dream to crush Kaido by yourself...

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:38.480
That dream was crushed to begin with.

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:47.200
In order to open the eyes of my stupid son to this reality, I came here.

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:51.960
<i>So what do you think?</i>

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.300
<i>Until we go from after-school club to an actual team,</i>

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:59.130
<i>could you be a short-term coach for them and help them grow?</i>

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:05.600
<i>I understand that it's volunteer work, so it's probably a bother for you...</i>

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:09.430
<i>No, I don't mind that at all.</i>

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:13.590
<i>It's just... It's probably hard to do so around my son.</i>

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:16.860
<i>That's exactly why I want to ask you to do this.</i>

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:21.550
<i>In the state he's in right now, he won't be able to beat Kaido.</i>

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:21.990
<i>No...</i>

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:26.450
<i>Even before then, the team will probably lose badly.</i>

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:32.010
<i>I beg you. Please lend us your power.</i>

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:36.000
<i>I understand.</i>

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:40.100
<i>But... even though I'm retired,</i>

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:45.220
<i>I'm still a pro baseball player, so I can't directly instruct them.</i>

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:47.890
<i>I'll look around.</i>

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.850
I'll say it once again.

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:54.150
Those who aren't willing to seriously play, leave right now.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:58.060
I don't need baseball players to just appear in the games.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:05.480
The school won't accept a club filled with people that just appear in games as an actual team.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.030
Isn't that right, sensei?

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.040
Yes, it's exactly as the coach says.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.210
H-Hey!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.260
T-Tashiro!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.800
What can we do with just three members?

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:31.100
If we can't enter in games, what's the point of practicing?

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:36.920
Next spring, if there are at least six guys that enter the club, I'll think about it.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:46.490
I guess we'll have to wait until the future to make the baseball team.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:49.350
And I had you two come all the way out here...

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.370
What a disappointment.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:51.200
Not at all.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:55.700
If there are ever members that actually want to play, we'll come again.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:56.910
Wait.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.630
Why are you doing this?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.950
Are you telling me not to play baseball during high school!?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:10.640
There's no point in playing for those guys, or for you right now.{AMS: TLC "playing for" huh?}

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:12.100
What?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:13.430
Goro.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:18.400
For a lonely human who doesn't have anything to protect,

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.770
you can't achieve any real accomplishments.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.480
Try to remember...{insert new fad, sangofe doesn't know how to}

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:30.070
Honda Shigeharu, who miraculously came back as a star batter.

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:43.250
And the you that kept throwing against the Yokohama Littles until you broke your shoulder...

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:47.420
They were never alone.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:58.950
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:02.100
<i>What does my old man and the me from back then have to do with anything?</i>

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:06.980
<i>I came to Seishuu because I wanted to beat Kaido by myself.</i>

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:14.340
<i>What the hell is the thing to protect other than myself?</i>

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:18.000
<i>What in the world is Dad trying to say?</i>

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:23.000
This is a free fansub.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:23.000
Not for sale or rent.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.470
So, you're up here, after all.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.400
What're you going to do?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:45.170
Unless you can get the others to want to play, making this into an actual baseball team is going to be impossible.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:47.690
Is it all right for you to just be sitting around?

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.700
Continuing the baseball team?

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:56.330
You're still talking about such a dream?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.850
It's impossible. Impossible.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:02.540
There's no way I can force guys who don't want to play... to play.

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:07.250
S-Shigeno!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.830
Are you saying that you got people all fired up about doing it,

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:12.480
then you just quit yourself!?

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.970
HEY!

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:35.460
Well, then I'm going first.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:36.950
Then, after you, I'll go.

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:39.410
100km/h is good, right?

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:41.140
Yeah, just start off from there.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.410
Try it, try it.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:44.920
<i>Those guys...</i>

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.950
Damn! I can't connect...{AMS: og tl - Damn! They won't hit...}

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.660
You're hitting under the ball.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.800
Why not try choking up on the bat?

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.030
I-I got a piece!{AMS: og tl - I-It hit!}

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:02.930
Keep going.

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.600
All right, I'm next.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.940
Hey!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.360
S-Shigeno-senpai!

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.800
What're you guys doing?

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.350
You seem to be having fun...

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.160
even though you quit the baseball team.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.930
No, this is... well...

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:24.540
We used to play baseball.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:27.170
Used to play?

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:31.260
Then you guys didn't quit because you didn't like baseball?

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.180
Y-Yeah...

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:38.140
I guess...

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:45.350
Well, if we really didn't like it we wouldn't have helped out with building the field.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:50.650
But it's too much. To have Kaido and Koshien as our goals...

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:52.140
You're right. 

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.900
The coaches were harsh,

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:55.500
and to catch those hard liners...

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:56.900
It's not really a case of being willing to or not...

00:13:56.900 --> 00:14:00.370
T-Then... if it isn't so suddenly, it's okay?

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:06.330
If you learn the basics little by little you guys wouldn't mind, right?

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.500
Y-Yeah.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:10.040
If that's the case, then sure.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:16.420
All right, I got it! In that case, I'll teach you everything!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.440
Senpai...

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:21.770
Okay!{AMS: too much of this will be a fade so we're not fading it}{insert new fad, sangofe doesn't know how to}

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:25.850
What? A basic practice just by ourselves?

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:27.070
Yeah, that's right.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.690
The first-years agreed. All that's left is you guys.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:32.850
Sounds like fun! Of course I'll do it too!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:38.220
Let's all learn how to catch those hard liners and shock your dad!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:39.660
Yeah.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.660
Uchiyama, Miyazaki, what about you guys?

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:48.710
Would you just quit it already?

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:53.480
You guys... if you weren't interested in judo, would you join the judo club?

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:57.290
If you didn't like art, would you join the art club just because someone told you to?

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:01.000
It's fine if you guys want to play.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:06.440
But we have no interest in playing catch, learning to catch hard liners, or anything else.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:14.300
Oh well...

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:18.650
but if we can get at least three others,
we can do something about it next spring.

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:19.740
Yeah...

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.870
Here we go!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.410
Get your waist down more!{Bring your waist down more!}

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:31.210
It's just a soft ball, so don't be so afraid of it!

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.670
Watch the ball till the very last moment!

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:34.430
Okay!

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:35.740
All right, once more!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:37.980
Okay!

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.570
Great job! Keep going!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:40.090
Okay!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:43.080
<i>The boys are ambitious...{AMS: changed "be" to "are" to have it make a bit more sense} {that part was in English... but not sure if it makes a whole lotta sense...}</i>

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.620
<i>It's not too much,</i>

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:47.620
<i>but it seems as though we've taken a small step forward.</i>

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.900
Last one!

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.190
Okay!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:05.690
How's this for one month's worth of practice?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:09.870
Were you shown progress beyond your expectations, Dad?

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:10.990
What should we do?

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:11.820
Yes, that's right...

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.050
{missing tl?}{AMS: can this be heard?}

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:14.900
Isn't this fine?

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.920
Just hurry up and recognize us as a team!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:18.890
We can't.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:19.840
What?

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.800
What happened to the odd couple?

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.230
They're impossible.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.340
They have absolutely no interest in playing baseball at all-

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.750
Have you tried a dogeza?{note here? -sangofe}

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.470
What?

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.150
There's no way you'd go that far, huh?

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:38.690
If you could do something like that, I wouldn't be here to begin with.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:44.550
Anyways, unless you get those two to join, there's no future for the baseball team.

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:45.530
Got it?

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.870
What did you say?

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.080
I don't get it.

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:57.050
What's up with those old men?
Now we have to get <i>everyone</i> to join?

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.430
Uchiyama and Miyazaki are saying they don't want to.

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:02.380
What else are they asking me to do?

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.880
Like they said, a dogeza.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:08.320
At this point, we should just plead with them.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:11.930
I think it'll be impossible.

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:15.890
Putting Miyazaki aside, Uchiyama is...

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:23.320
Who is it?

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:26.280
Um... this is Shigeno Goro.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:30.500
Who are you?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.240
You are?

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.790
Like I said... I'm Shigeno Goro...

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.390
I'm one of Uchiyama's friends.

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:37.380
You're not my friend!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:38.720
Not my friend!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:42.850
Uh... I meant your older brother, Uchiyama.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:45.950
If you're a friend say the password.

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:46.660
Huh?

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:47.110
Curry.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.420
Rice?

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:49.690
H-Hey, wait a minute!

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.850
Udon? Is it cha han? Bread?

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:53.050
Hey!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:55.330
Is it rice crackers? Soba? Is it soba!?

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.230
Shigeno?

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.230
W-Wha-

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:58.730
What're you doing?

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.650
Make it!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:06.720
I heard from Tashiro...

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:07.730
about you.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:12.600
Since your parents work, you have to stay home and take care of your brother and sister, right?

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:13.370
Yeah...

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:19.090
It's uncool to say that I can't do clubs because of a reason like that, right?

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:21.090
That's not true.

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:25.090
It's not uncool at all.

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:29.730
I'm sorry... without knowing...

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:32.850
To force you into joining and making the field...

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:34.120
S-Shigeno!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.810
You came all the way out here just to say that?

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:38.520
Didn't you want me to...

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:39.550
Yeah,

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.430
that's what I originally came here to do.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:45.180
I have a little brother and sister too,

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:47.970
and there're times when I think that they're incredibly noisy,

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:49.330
but they're cute, aren't they?

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.100
Watching your siblings...

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:57.430
I just couldn't steal their older brother away from them.

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:05.670
Actually...

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:06.960
Actually!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:08.760
I really want to participate in clubs too!

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:12.960
Of course...

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.970
I have to take my siblings to and from school,

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:18.930
and I have to prepare dinner for them so every day wouldn't be possible.

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:22.400
But, if it's not a bother to you...

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:25.530
In the mornings... or even at night...

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:27.870
Could you teach me how to play baseball?

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:32.080
U-Uchiyama...

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:34.450
All right, come!

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.570
Oh, whoops.

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:49.770
This time already? Morning practice ends here, huh?

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:50.220
Yeah.

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:55.720
But your senses are better than I had anticipated.

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:56.910
Really?

00:19:56.910 --> 00:20:00.520
Well... even if I look like this, during junior high I played basketball.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:06.940
Y-Yo... Miyazaki.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.080
Traitor.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:20.000
See ya later. At night, if you have time, practice swinging.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.010
Yeah.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:24.630
Miyazaki!

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:29.180
Do you want to do morning practice, too?

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:31.780
When you start doing it, it's actually pretty fun.

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.990
Did Shigeno ask you to do this?

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:35.170
Don't talk to me.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.720
I'm not friends with you anymore or anything.

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:40.720
Miyazaki!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.050
He's not that bad. 

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.690
If he's that bad of a person,

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:48.420
then Tashiro and Fuji wouldn't have joined the baseball team!

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:54.890
<i>Stop joking.</i>

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:57.690
<i>Athletes... </i>

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:00.300
<i>they're all a bunch of show-offs.</i>

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:05.580
<i>They just wave their natural athletic abilities in front of others.</i>

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:10.030
<i>First, it started with dodgeball.
That used to be fun for me, even if I was bad at it.</i>

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:14.430
<i>Basketball and soccer too.
Because of "them" they became less fun for me.{AMS: tlc reported it as fine}</i>

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:18.200
<i>They make me mad.</i>

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.850
<i>Shigeno is also like that.</i>

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:22.270
<i>Making a fool out of me.</i>

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:26.440
Yo.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:31.730
S-Shigeno! What do you want? What about the club?

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:33.600
I told you that I wouldn't join the baseball team!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:37.550
Don't be like that. Where are you heading now?

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:39.500
W-Where?

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:43.790
I'm just going to the arcade, then the convenience store, and then home.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.170
What's wrong with that?

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.250
I see.

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:49.710
Then... can I come with you?

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:51.680
W-What?

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:10.910
Hey, isn't this enough already?

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:12.610
How long are you going to follow me for?

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:15.360
I guess until you join the baseball team.

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:16.820
What?

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:20.890
But if you don't want to, then there's nothing I can do about it.

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:25.550
I just thought I'd start as friends,
but if that's still a bother to you, then...

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:26.680
I'll go home right now.

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:28.300
A-As friends?

00:22:28.300 --> 00:22:30.930
Yeah... although we're not even friends...

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:34.010
To ask you to join the baseball team... it's kind of rude.

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:36.380
My feelings won't reach you, huh?

00:22:37.640 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Friends...</i>

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:41.350
<i>This guy wants to be friends with me?</i>

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:42.350
I see...

00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:44.260
I'm sorry.

00:22:45.580 --> 00:22:46.730
Wait.

00:22:47.610 --> 00:22:49.530
I-I suck.

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:54.860
Make a promise! That you won't laugh even if I suck!

00:22:56.800 --> 00:23:01.530
Well, duh. Who would laugh at someone who tries hard?

00:23:02.350 --> 00:23:05.290
I got it. Then I'll do it.

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:08.250
Zaki-chan! 

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.550
Stop it!

00:24:40.380 --> 00:24:43.260
Practice begins for Seishuu's baseball team!

00:24:43.260 --> 00:24:45.010
The only thing left is to beat Kaido!

00:24:45.340 --> 00:24:48.310
And then a mysterious baseball kid appears.

00:24:48.310 --> 00:24:51.400
This kid... he's really good. Who is he?

00:24:52.400 --> 00:24:53.590
Next time, on Major: 

00:24:53.590 --> 00:24:55.020
A Sudden Visitor.

00:24:55.020 --> 00:24:57.490
Run to the stage of your dreams!
